sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant G as dynamic_gate.py
  participant B as bench.py
  participant Y as yarac and yara
  participant C as compare()
  G->>B: build_corpus (random, text, system files, canaries)
  loop runs, alternating baseline and candidate
    G->>B: measure_set(previous release)
    B->>Y: yarac one namespace per file
    B->>Y: yara -C per corpus file, timeout 10 s
    Y-->>B: cpu, max RSS, wall, exit status
    G->>B: measure_set(candidate)
  end
  G->>C: baseline runs vs candidate runs
  alt regression, crash or timeout
    C-->>G: verdict regression
    G->>G: ddmin over new or changed files
    G->>G: culprits to quarantine, rebuild the set
    G->>B: measure the reduced set again
  else within thresholds
    C-->>G: verdict ok
    G->>Y: canaries must all be detected
  end
